Note on data and trained artifacts
----------------------------------

This licence covers the source code in this repository.

It does not cover the IEEE-CIS Fraud Detection dataset, which is not
distributed here and remains subject to the terms of the Kaggle competition it
was released under. The trained artifacts committed to this repository
(artifacts/graph_model.json, artifacts/gateway_model.json and their metadata)
are derived from that dataset; anyone reusing them for a purpose beyond
research or evaluation should check those terms first.
